#>wonder_agents_plans_runtimedxfoundation_wip_1
?["When the same malformed .spw file fails in the CLI and in the LSP, do the two messages share any wording, and does either say what to do next?"]{
  #:depth #!educational // lens: service design
  $^["open"]@here => $^["commits"]@here
  ~#hypothesis: "the messages share nothing and neither names a next action."
  !probe{ "feed one malformed fixture to npm run spw:ls or the validator and to publishDiagnostics in packages/spw-lsp/src/handlers/analysis.ts, whose message is '<rule>: parse error'; compare words for what failed, where, and what to do next." }
  $%[diagnostic.shared_words, diagnostic.has_next_action]
}
